.claude/
AUDIT_FINDINGS.md
# ...and their timestamped backups. `PLAN*.md` does not match `PLAN.md.bak_…`
# because the pattern has to end in .md, so every rewrite left another file
# showing as untracked.
PLAN*.bak*
# Design proposals of the same class as the docs above (both marked 提案（未実装）).
TTS_MISREADING_CHECK_*.md

# Timestamped snapshots taken before editing a tracked data file. The tracked
# file is the record; these are undo buffers.
*.archive_*

